        {
          "type": "h2",
          "text": "THE SITUATION"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "An independent wine shop in Dublin with a great range, a small online store and no way to be found beyond its own street."
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "Supermarkets and national chains owned the generic searches. The shop's edge was its range and its advice, neither of which showed up in a Shopping ad."
        },
        {
          "type": "h2",
          "text": "WHAT WE CHANGED"
        },
        {
          "type": "ol",
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Shopping campaigns structured by region and price, with the feed cleaned product by product",
              "href": null,
              "imgs": []
            },
            {
              "text": "Search campaigns on specific producers and styles the supermarkets do not stock",
              "href": null,
              "imgs": []
            },
            {
              "text": "A weekly email from the owner: three bottles, one story each",
              "href": null,
              "imgs": []
            },
            {
              "text": "Checkout simplified from five steps to two, with delivery costs shown up front",
              "href": null,
              "imgs": []
            },
            {
              "text": "Gift and Christmas campaigns planned from September",
              "href": null,
              "imgs": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "h2",
          "text": "WHAT HAPPENED"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "Google Ads returns 5.1x and the weekly email now drives 22% of online revenue."
        }
      ]
